mutation claim ignores a live lease
detects OneBrowser
- /\ pc[r] = "queued" /\ (holder = None \/ ttl = 0)
+ /\ pc[r] = "queued"

mutation asking for help does not pause the agent
detects OneDriver
-     /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![r] = "waiting"]
-     /\ UNCHANGED <<lease, mine, claimer, answer, acked, staleWrite, restart>>
+     /\ UNCHANGED <<lease, pc, mine, claimer, answer, acked, staleWrite, restart>>

mutation a done answer is read as unanswered
detects NoLostDone
-     /\ \/ help[r] = "done" /\ answer' = [answer EXCEPT ![r] = "helped"] /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![r] = "working"]
+     /\ \/ help[r] = "done" /\ answer' = [answer EXCEPT ![r] = "unanswered"] /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![r] = "stopping"]

mutation writes check only the fence, not the holder
detects NoStaleWrite
-     /\ IF ~FencedWrites \/ (holder = r /\ fence = mine[r])
+     /\ IF ~FencedWrites \/ fence >= mine[r]

mutation the agent never re-reads after expiring
detects AllDone
-     /\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![r] = "waiting"]
-     /\ UNCHANGED <<lease, mine, claimer, helpTtl, answer, acked, staleWrite, restart>>
+     /\ UNCHANGED <<lease, pc, mine, claimer, helpTtl, answer, acked, staleWrite, restart>>

mutation a claim skips a fence number
detects TypeOK
-     /\ holder' = r /\ ttl' = LeaseTTL /\ fence' = fence + 1
+     /\ holder' = r /\ ttl' = LeaseTTL /\ fence' = fence + 2

mutation the run is redeployed before it lets go of its lease
detects NoSelfSkip
-     /\ pc[r] = "restarting" /\ want[r]
+     /\ pc[r] \in {"stopping", "restarting"} /\ want[r]

mutation restarts are not counted
detects AllDone
cfg Live-AllDone
- /\ want' = [want EXCEPT ![r] = FALSE] /\ restarts' = [restarts EXCEPT ![r] = restarts[r] + 1]
+ /\ want' = [want EXCEPT ![r] = FALSE] /\ restarts' = restarts
